#
# Unisys visorinput configuration
#

config UNISYS_VISORINPUT
	tristate "Unisys visorinput driver"
	depends on UNISYSSPAR && UNISYS_VISORBUS && FB
	---help---
	If you say Y here, you will enable the Unisys visorinput driver.

